s telegraph system strikes. The intent shows which system is targeted and when. When the strike lands, any cards of that system still in your hand are locked for your next turn, stamped SYSTEM OFFLINE. So the turn before a strike is a decision. Fire everything in that ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T16:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944572","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5077820-1846018067929111","game_id":"steam-5077820","kind":"announcement","title":"Starhand is in Steam Next Fest","summary":"Starhand is a roguelite deckbuilder where your cards are your ship. Every card draws on a system (Weapons, Shields, Engines, Scanners, Engineering), and enemies don't just chew your hull. They shoot systems offline and lock those cards out of your hand. The Next Fest demo covers the first two zones with two pilots: Drifter: draws an extra card every turn; flexible and forgiving. Ironclad: a heavy juggernaut that turns incoming punishment into forward pressure. Every run is different. The full ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T10:15:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5077820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5077820":"2026-10-26T08:00:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5077820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:35Z"},"5172540":{"last_attempt_at":"2